    faqs: [{ question: 'Is three follow-ups too many?', answer: 'It may be for a small job and reasonable for a long project cycle if the contacts were agreed and useful. The number alone does not make the sequence good.' }, { question: 'Should I call as well as text?', answer: 'Use the customer’s preferred channel and the importance of the quote. Avoid piling a call, text and email on top of one another without a plan.' }, { question: 'How many does TradieRelay send now?', answer: 'The current working flow schedules one automatic check 24 hours after an approved quote is sent, and cancels it when the quote no longer needs follow-up.' }],
