    faqs: [{ question: 'Does viewed mean the customer received the SMS?', answer: 'It confirms the valid quote page was opened. It does not prove who opened it or that the SMS was read in full.' }, { question: 'Should I follow up immediately after a view?', answer: 'Usually no. That can feel intrusive. Follow the agreed timing and use viewed only as context.' }, { question: 'Can a customer view the quote more than once?', answer: 'Yes. Repeat opens should not create duplicate jobs or imply stronger intent.' }],
