    directAnswer: 'Usually, yes. The simplest setup keeps the existing business number and forwards selected calls to a dedicated AI receptionist number. If the business changes telcos, many active Australian mobile, local, 1800 and 13/1300 numbers can also be ported, subject to the gaining provider accepting the port and completing identity checks.',
