    directAnswer: 'A narrow tradie setup can often be prepared and tested within two business days after the owner supplies the phone, service-area, job and routing information. Complex teams take longer. The technical connection is only one part: the business must approve the greeting, rules, alerts, fallbacks and acceptance-test results before real calls go live.',
