    checklist: ['Define the exact coverage gap.', 'Cost the correct employment arrangement.', 'Cost setup, monthly and usage fees.', 'Value owner oversight.', 'Keep human-only decisions visible.', 'Test a blended model.', 'Compare service and customer outcomes.'],
    faqs: [{ question: 'Will AI replace my receptionist?', answer: 'It should not be framed that way when the person does high-context work. Use AI to remove repetitive intake and overflow, then keep the human on decisions and relationships.' }, { question: 'Can a human receptionist answer after hours?', answer: 'Yes, through a roster or external service. Compare the actual coverage hours and responsibilities with the AI plan.' }, { question: 'Which award applies to reception staff?', answer: 'It depends on the role, employer and industry. Fair Work tools or professional advice should be used; the Clerks Award is relevant to many private-sector clerical roles but is not universal.' }],
